---
import "@/styles/inventory.css";
---
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Inventario Luxe </title>
    <meta name="description" content="Una experiencia elegante y profesional para gestionar tu inventario con total claridad y eficiencia." />
  </head>
  <body class="relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-[#fafbfe] text-slate-800">
    
    <!-- Ambient Glow Orbs -->
    <div class="glow-orb bg-[#001A6E] w-[500px] h-[500px] top-[-100px] right-[-150px]"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb bg-[#00D2C4] w-[400px] h-[400px] bottom-[-50px] left-[-150px]"></div>
    
    <!-- Grid Overlay Pattern -->
    <div class="grid-overlay"></div>

    <main class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-7xl flex-col px-4 py-6 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Premium Navbar -->
      <header class="mb-12 flex items-center justify-between rounded-full border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 px-6 py-3 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,26,110,0.02)] backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#001A6E] to-[#0b2f95] text-white">
            <svg class="h-4.5 w-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mt-0.5">Inventario Luxe</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a 
          href="/inventory/" 
          class="rounded-full bg-[#001A6E] px-5 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-md shadow-blue-900/10 transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#0b2f95] hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95"
        >
          Abrir Panel
        </a>
      </header>

      <!-- Hero Section: Split Content & CSS Mockup -->
      <section class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:py-8">
        
        <!-- Left Side: Copywriting -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 border border-blue-200/30">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Nueva versión de diseño dividida
          </span>
          
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl leading-[1.15]">
            Tu inventario, con una apariencia <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-[#0b2f95]">limpia y profesional.</span>
          </h1>
          
          <p class="text-base leading-8 text-slate-500 max-w-xl">
            Optimiza la gestión de tus productos en una interfaz de doble columna inspirada en la identidad corporativa de Aliados. Totalmente responsivo, rápido y con métricas automáticas en tiempo real.
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
            <a 
              href="/inventory/" 
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#001A6E] to-[#0b2f95] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/15 transition duration-300 hover:shadow-blue-900/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95"
            >
              Comenzar ahora
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a 
              href="#funciones" 
              class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 shadow-sm transition hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-800 active:scale-95"
            >
              Ver características
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: Advanced HTML/CSS Dashboard Mockup -->
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
          <!-- Background glow inside mockup -->
          <div class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#00D2C4]/20 to-[#001A6E]/10 blur-xl opacity-80"></div>
          
          <!-- Mockup Frame -->
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-900/5">
            
            <!-- Mockup Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-3.5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>
                <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span>
                <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span class="ml-2 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Aliados Dashboard</span>
              </div>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-extrabold text-emerald-600 border border-emerald-200/30">Local Activo</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Mockup Content: Mini Split Layout -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[110px_1fr] gap-3 mt-3">
              
              <!-- Mini Sidebar -->
              <div class="space-y-2 border-r border-slate-100 pr-2">
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-2 border border-slate-100">
                  <p class="text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400">PRODUCTOS</p>
                  <p class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-800">24</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-2 border border-slate-100">
                  <p class="text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400">STOCK TOTAL</p>
                  <p class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-800">410</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-2 border border-slate-100">
                  <p class="text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400">CATEGORÍAS</p>
                  <p class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-800">6</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Mini Table / Database -->
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <span class="text-[9px] font-extrabold text-slate-500 uppercase">Lista de Stock</span>
                  <span class="text-[8px] text-blue-600 font-bold">+ Agregar</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Row 1 -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50/50 p-2 border border-slate-100/50">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
                    <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-blue-50 text-[9px] font-bold text-blue-600">I</span>
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 truncate leading-none">Impresora Láser</p>
                      <p class="text-[7px] text-slate-400">Hardware</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="rounded bg-emerald-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-emerald-600">12 uds</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Row 2 -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50/50 p-2 border border-slate-100/50">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0">
                    <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-indigo-50 text-[9px] font-bold text-indigo-600">L</span>
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-700 truncate leading-none">Laptop Corporativa</p>
                      <p class="text-[7px] text-slate-400">Equipos</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="rounded bg-amber-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-amber-600">3 uds</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Category Breakdown Mockup -->
                <div class="pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 space-y-1">
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-500">
                    <span>Impresión</span>
                    <span>65%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="h-1 w-full rounded-full bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="h-full bg-blue-600 rounded-full" style="width: 65%"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- Features Cards Section -->
      <section id="funciones" class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-slate-100">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
          <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-blue-600">Características</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-2">Todo lo que necesitas para tu flujo de trabajo</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <article class="interactive-card rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.01)] backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 border border-blue-100/30 mb-4">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">Doble Columna Modular</h3>
            <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400 mt-2">
              Un panel con barra lateral pegajosa y área de datos optimizada que aprovecha cada píxel de pantallas panorámicas.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <article class="interactive-card rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.01)] backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 border border-emerald-100/30 mb-4">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">Widgets & Métricas Vivas</h3>
            <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400 mt-2">
              Visualiza alertas de stock bajo y gráficos de barra con la distribución de categorías calculadas instantáneamente.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <article class="interactive-card rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.01)] backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-100/30 mb-4">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">Filtro Instantáneo</h3>
            <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400 mt-2">
              Encuentra lo que buscas al escribir. Búsqueda instantánea en el cliente integrada en la interfaz corporativa.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="mt-20 py-8 border-t border-slate-100 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
        <p>© 2026 Aliados Facilísimo. Panel de Gestión de Inventario Luxe. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      </footer>
      
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
